msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Sega - Dreamcast/Naomi (Flycast)"
msgstr "Sega — Dreamcast/Naomi (Flycast)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Flycast is a fork of Reicast, a multi-platform Sega Dreamcast emulator."
msgstr "Flycast — это форк Reicast, кроссплатформенного эмулятора Sega Dreamcast."

